From: Yi Kong <yikong@google.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Jun 2025 14:33:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "[Clang][counted_by] Refactor
 __builtin_dynamic_object_size on FAMs (#122198)"

This reverts commit cff0a460ae864505bc2a064c269ebe548aa35949.
---
 clang/lib/CodeGen/CGBuiltin.cpp      | 508 ++++++---------
 clang/lib/CodeGen/CodeGenFunction.h  |  18 +-
 clang/test/CodeGen/attr-counted-by.c | 912 +++++++++------------------
 3 files changed, 488 insertions(+), 950 deletions(-)

diff --git a/clang/lib/CodeGen/CGBuiltin.cpp b/clang/lib/CodeGen/CGBuiltin.cpp
index 11fa295dad95..7ec9d59bfed5 100644
--- a/clang/lib/CodeGen/CGBuiltin.cpp
+++ b/clang/lib/CodeGen/CGBuiltin.cpp
